{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 This is &quot;<strong>Nun of Your Business&quot;</strong> \ud83d\udd25</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-packed battlefield where anime-styled warrior nuns cleanse the world of demonic corruption! \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc7c</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fa1fc7795ff874b083bb8158d6b06e17.poster.avif?t=1756659530\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fa1fc7795ff874b083bb8158d6b06e17.webm?t=1756659530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude4f Select from a powerful roster of anime-styled nuns.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From a nun to an angelic looking warrior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master unique holy warriors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the unholy monsters from Hell. <br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/8bc2c50553fa31f2b286e03adc837317.poster.avif?t=1756659530\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/8bc2c50553fa31f2b286e03adc837317.webm?t=1756659530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc79 Battle grotesque demons, skeletal hordes, and corrupted abominations that crawl from the deepest pits of hell.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay waves of twisted monsters born from darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to varied enemy attack patterns and unholy tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purge arenas filled with hellish threats and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fe3892de75e579d8bbed81e125725ef8.poster.avif?t=1756659530\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/extras/fe3892de75e579d8bbed81e125725ef8.webm?t=1756659530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 Face off against monstrous bosses in intense encounters that will test your aim, timing, and divine wrath.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in cinematic battles against towering horrors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and counter deadly boss mechanics and phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash ultimate skills to deliver divine judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When sacred vows meet unholy war... prepare for divine retribution.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932990?t=1756659530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/493cbb43a1ddadab48719efaf7ba58a1ad3fff75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756659530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/97c4b5443593c62a039ff54452d3039f2f23a709/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756659530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932990/97c4b5443593c62a039ff54452d3039f2f23a709/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756659530","categ